# EcoGen AI Version 2.0 – System Architecture & Implementation Roadmap

## Project Vision

EcoGen AI is an AI-powered sustainability intelligence platform designed to help individuals understand, monitor, predict, and improve their environmental impact. The platform integrates Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Digital Twin Technology, Carbon Analytics, Recommendation Systems, and Sustainability Intelligence into a single personalized ecosystem.

Unlike traditional carbon calculators that provide only static results, EcoGen AI continuously analyzes user sustainability data, generates personalized recommendations, tracks long-term progress, predicts future environmental impact, and assists users in achieving sustainable living goals.

The next generation of EcoGen AI transforms the existing application into a complete AI-powered sustainability platform with user authentication, historical data management, intelligent dashboards, and personalized AI services.

---

# Phase 1 – Authentication & User Management

## Objective

Develop a secure authentication system that enables users to create personal accounts, securely access the platform, and maintain persistent sustainability records.

---

## Purpose

The authentication module acts as the foundation of the entire EcoGen AI platform by uniquely identifying every user and enabling personalized sustainability analysis.

---

## Functional Components

### User Registration

Users can create a new account by providing:

* Full Name
* Email Address
* Password
* Confirm Password

The system validates all information before creating the account.

---

### User Login

Registered users authenticate using:

* Email Address
* Password

After successful authentication, a secure session is created.

---

### Session Management

After login, the application stores:

* User ID
* User Name
* Login Timestamp

using Streamlit session management.

Example:

```
st.session_state["user_id"]
st.session_state["user_name"]
```

Every page in EcoGen AI uses this information to retrieve personalized data.

---

## Database Design

Table: users

Fields

* user_id
* full_name
* email
* password_hash
* created_at
* last_login

Passwords are never stored as plain text.

Industry-standard password hashing is used for security.

---

## Integration

Authentication is connected to:

* Dashboard
* EcoTwin AI
* Reports
* Rewards
* Green Planner
* AI Coach
* Community Analytics

---

## Outputs

* Registered User
* Authenticated Session
* User Identity
* Secure Login State

---

## Success Criteria

* Users can register securely.
* Users can log in successfully.
* Every page recognizes the authenticated user.
* User sessions remain active until logout.

